//! The lint rule tables of SDK 3.6.2 (docs/ANALYZER-ESPECIFICACAO-INFRA.md §8):
//! the registry of the 240 rules ([`tabela_g`]) and the codes they report
//! ([`codigos_g`]), generated by `scripts/gerar-tabelas-analise.py`. The
//! implemented rules are in [`rules`] to [`rules33`] ([`walk`] is the walk with
//! ancestors and [`strings`] re-reads the string literals and the comments);
//! the tables also serve the validation of `linter: rules:` in
//! `analysis_options.yaml` (`crate::naodart::options`).
//!
